      Spec FR-09 + design §2.3 (Draft Alternative) + §7 (Catalog Roster row 4, declares the `compose` disposition) + §7.2 (dispatch sequence, Draft-Alternative leg materializes from the ledger). The one edit-producing catalog row: the structured payload is a ledger `SessionOutput` with the core `compose` disposition (§1 of the HANDOFF contract), addressable as `{bindingId}@t{n}` so the Workspace tags provenance and can supersede it on undo/replace (FR-17). Depends on FR-04 draft-into-editor (task 016) landing the disposition + SSE-frame consumption path.
