  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-039">Action row + Binding row; the Binding is the ONLY routing config and carries the `compose` disposition member. NO new dispatch endpoint; NO string-key routing. Mirror-first through the core's hoisted description source. Eval cases gate the change. OutputSchemaJson MUST pass OpenAiFunctionSchemaValidator — property-level boolean `required` BANNED (the `match_mode` enum is expressed via the OpenAI-subset `enum` keyword, not a boolean required).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-040">The edit payload is a `SessionOutput` with the `compose` disposition written to the ledger BEFORE any render; the Workspace materializes the pending track-change from the stored entry with `{bindingId}@t{n}` provenance. No client-side-only edit buffer. Undo/replace = supersession (FR-17), never DOM undo.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Engine FROZEN — prompted Action, not a playbook. Consumes the R1 `compose-selection` scope.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">Golden + dispatch eval families ≥5 each ship with the row (task 045).</constraint>
