    <step order="1" name="Author Action row">Via jps-action-create, author a structured-edit SystemPrompt (adeu §6.1: LLM emits target_text/new_text/match_mode/rationale/sources, NOT free-form markup) + OutputSchemaJson `{target_text, new_text, match_mode enum[strict,first,all], rationale, sources[]}`, Temperature, ModelDeploymentId. Write mirrors under infra/dataverse/ through the hoisted source.</step>
