    <step order="3" name="Validate schema">jps-validate: OutputSchemaJson passes OpenAiFunctionSchemaValidator; `match_mode` via enum keyword; NO property-level boolean `required`.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Verify ledger-first path">Confirm the dispatched output writes a `compose`-disposition SessionOutput to the ledger before render, addressable as `{bindingId}@t{n}`, through the shipped seam (zero new routes).</step>
  </steps>

